{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24984","headline":"题徐俞山居 · 牟融","name":"题徐俞山居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青山重叠巧裁攒，引水流泉夜激湍。\n岚锁岩扉清昼瞑，云归松壑翠阴寒。\n不因李相门前见，曾向袁生画里看。\n老我不堪诗思杳，几回吟倚曲栏干。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牟融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24984.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24984","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}